### Product aanmaken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Widget",
  "price": 19.99,
  "stockQuantity": 100
}

### Customer aanmaken (Standard)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jan Janssens",
  "email": "jan@example.com",
  "discountTier": 1
}

### Customer aanmaken (Premium)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Premium Klant",
  "email": "premium@example.com",
  "discountTier": 0
}

### Order plaatsen — happy path
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "orderLines": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Order plaatsen — te weinig voorraad (verwacht: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "orderLines": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 99999 }
  ]
}

### Order plaatsen — niet-bestaande Customer (verwacht: 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 9999,
  "orderLines": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Zonder token (verwacht: 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products